  year    = {1984},
  doi     = {10.1016/0550-3213(84)90611-4},
  note    = {元数据经 INSPIRE 核实（含 freetext「Nucl. Phys. B248 (1984) 551-569 and Florida Univ. Gainesville - UFTP-84-004 (84,REC.AUG.) 35p」）。**这是 lian-zuckerman-1991 参考文献里的 [T1]**，LZ 把「D 维玻色 Fock 空间的无鬼定理」归给 [GT, T1, LZ, FGZ] 四篇，其中 Thorn 的那篇是本文，不是 thorn-1987。
             INSPIRE 逐字全摘要：「We relate some mathematical results concerning the Virasoro algebra to properties of dual models. Specifically, we show how to compute the Kac determinant using well known techniques from dual models. Then we use the Kac formula to discuss the validity of the no-ghost theorem of dual models in a more general setting than the original proofs of that theorem.」
             「in a more general setting」与 Kac 行列式路线都与 a<1 分支吻合，是该分支物理侧原始出处的**最强候选**，但**摘要没有写出条件本身**，正文未获取（Elsevier 403），故仅摘要级（L2）。找扫描件的钥匙是报告号 UFTP-84-004。见 extractions/primary-sources-round2.md §4。}
}

